{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>台灣新竹一名年輕移工（外勞）日前在羽毛球運動中遭高速羽毛球擊中頭部，初期僅自行休息返家，卻隨後出現劇烈嘔吐症狀，經送醫搶救三天後仍宣告不治。此案例引發醫界關注，台大（台灣大學）名譽教授、神經外科醫師高明見接受《中時新聞網》採訪，揭露頭部外傷可能引發的致命危機。</p><p>高明見指出，高速羽毛球雖具有一定程度的撞擊力，但若遭擊中頭部後短時間內出現劇烈嘔吐，最有可能的情況就是腦出血。他進一步解釋，許多腦動脈瘤或先天腦血管畸形患者平日看似無恙，但當突然遭逢外力撞擊時，這股外力可能足以誘發腦動脈瘤破裂，導致大量腦出血。</p><figure><img alt=\"示意圖（Unsplash@Md Mahdi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186690960214462464963512.jpeg/rXfgnF_daFgikaJdMyFtAsDFXMP8TM434fdXaeH3V2k\"/><figcaption>示意圖（Unsplash@Md Mahdi）</figcaption></figure><p>患者可能在短短幾十分鐘或數小時內，出現頭痛、劇烈嘔吐，甚至昏迷等症狀，隨著腦壓升高，甚至可能抑制呼吸而導致死亡。</p><p>高明見另提醒，頭部遭受外力撞擊也可能導致硬腦膜下出血。患者剛開始可能只是感受到被打到部位的疼痛，但隨著血液持續滲漏累積，達到一定程度時，患者可能突然陷入昏迷。值得注意的是，這類症狀需要時間發展，甚至可能在幾天後才出現，容易被忽視。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀】延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964557449702936576873621.jpeg/2ZROLj4byFkCcNcGNyBkk6wcxl0KhY7EVZnRn1WZ0Z8\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀】延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964557452014129152892317.jpeg/NVQQNQ-T6CyQLkqwyqGP4u1gA0BRBopIA2LXzANi18w\"/><figcaption>延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964557454946078720682593.jpeg/Yi3-ZApiY4e5SbpmogwTTwDi9eO8iEs7dAHuWnQB7lo\"/><figcaption>延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964557456846229504604915.jpeg/holepRiMymz4fZ7Oo8b2anVEh0lVPG_8rc5AYa3OQGE\"/><figcaption>延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964557458675077120670413.jpeg/Ty_udlRPUB3fNlAM66Roz6nUuNMvkE-H-dPR3_nT0d8\"/><figcaption>延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964557449778434048407982.jpeg/o6lPh3qV5Z2cZyYoYxRFyvtFipiEcXTel9ukbpfbpG4\"/><figcaption>延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964557452437753856796384.jpeg/4fELIUizLCjmcdzfBnDluQ4fj-90cifvvFOG0LxThtA\"/><figcaption>延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964557455365509120586712.jpeg/Xtn7vfdemlFEXLO4qjWYKpVTwo3sVzJfYbZbzGG2W8w\"/><figcaption>延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964557457534095360685739.jpeg/V-uDzpytlJalIaumNA6sAEAZYG1DTNwb2T4khtk-JIY\"/><figcaption>延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964557459149033472435176.jpeg/EQfk_ZJ6gA6PdohO2xBBCSyINCAbOR7ih2tHiYdrR4k\"/><figcaption>延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964557449778434048724653.jpeg/xs1M2CczrJqne7qo-17bsGTy7KHhmlI80lS9k9JUvZM\"/><figcaption>延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964557452009934848639827.jpeg/QLHNjEiTIm04JSJDuf-2mJHlvTjFyzW-qZpt5amabeU\"/><figcaption>延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964557454946078720105376.jpeg/SAq2dEH6s9v2y-FaKFn4a025VPMWJ7RsTNqKoUzaiqE\"/><figcaption>延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964557457144025088461583.jpeg/nK-PLBYq7GNmfhSv1L9zuUp4XXosv7rAZRkYiWUZGIk\"/><figcaption>延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964557458868015104623041.jpeg/UBduNgg8-td5BY_Ei-upqrX1rYTFb3-xGlAjshpQI7I\"/><figcaption>延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964557449069596672273486.jpeg/K8H8WKSjlh1DwEMTQkbCx18ArNc7egzeNArOfTQKzn0\"/><figcaption>延遲性肌肉痠痛要吃什麼？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>高明見特別提醒民眾，頭部遭外力撞擊後若出現以下症狀，務必立即就醫。首先是頭痛、頭暈症狀，包括持續劇烈頭痛、頭暈、噴射性嘔吐或複視（看東西有重疊影像）。其次是手腳無力，表現為單側肢體無力或發麻、走路不穩。</p><p>第三類為抽搐症狀，包括發生癲癇或抽筋、頸部僵硬。最後是意識改變，如嗜睡、叫不醒、反應遲鈍或昏迷等情況。醫師強調，這些症狀任何一項出現都應視為警訊，不應延誤就醫時機。</p><p>【延伸閱讀】心肌梗塞前兩天男子牙疼背痛　警惕7大心臟病發症狀　附護心8訣竅（點擊放大瀏覽）</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閲讀】心梗來臨之前身體會「報警」（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251105/1062801070574538752915236.png/zb_LWWSw4p_TAys5B3HbbtTLvWKTPEHxbcUAUm3FAFI\"/><figcaption>【延伸閲讀】心梗來臨之前身體會「報警」（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7大心梗前兆（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251105/1062756382660497408375026.png/idsU2TfdSHlv35tWMntEDMrvtnaUlKfRByuWZAcrlmQ\"/><figcaption>7大心梗前兆（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"1. 胸痛胸悶出大汗（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251105/1062756385084936192762048.png/jYYWmOU-nw6KfJRIGDe0LoeA0PzBJWjHFZvD5hWbw-Y\"/><figcaption>1. 胸痛胸悶出大汗（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"1. 胸痛胸悶出大汗（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251105/1062756387089944576608953.png/qjmYyeGnsradjEh4MqJq8FvDFlcqSyrPR6oTt0eqE7c\"/><figcaption>1. 胸痛胸悶出大汗（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2. 長時間噁心嘔吐（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251105/1062756389212393472249658.png/SCspiwb0LujGZ_Hr97Q5PgkI2TIm-riDCU0vzwlNL88\"/><figcaption>2. 長時間噁心嘔吐（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2. 長時間噁心嘔吐（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251105/1062756379829211136348276.png/jiXLy1wk7Pb6LiCSeYBzl5u_dpBnBmZxdR6uu3Uerrs\"/><figcaption>2. 長時間噁心嘔吐（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"3. 咽喉部發緊難受（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251105/1062756382182346752039516.png/TsYE5B5JWh54wfPMkdMz4dkJjNNNCJC3f-a22X_mttk\"/><figcaption>3. 咽喉部發緊難受（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"3. 咽喉部發緊難受（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251105/1062756384468373504370254.png/EkqLsHpwmb4v_poaYb1dFbdy7EK2zsh6Gf0AlRn9AJU\"/><figcaption>3. 咽喉部發緊難受（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"4. 左肩膀和手臂疼（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251105/1062756386645348352682395.png/DIZfJU-MHSgw-slklLmQPo_mu9UCqJnlW2t8PVtrfD0\"/><figcaption>4. 左肩膀和手臂疼（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"4. 左肩膀和手臂疼（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251105/1062756388801351680904653.png/ZOCR6iMPw7eOTfTV81eVbclgxTnj_HynejOxl3ozsZc\"/><figcaption>4. 左肩膀和手臂疼（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5. 持續有背部疼痛（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251105/1062756379887931392560412.png/lNUn-7giiZjJwMfbOeefLQ5pXuYvkwaoJ4xLeyeMS3s\"/><figcaption>5. 持續有背部疼痛（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5. 持續有背部疼痛（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251105/1062756382098460672931286.png/S-n1b0TUbObQTZqO7Yn-YwuUPbtnO5PJF1271Rddu9U\"/><figcaption>5. 持續有背部疼痛（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"6. 出現上腹部疼痛（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251105/1062756384212520960705416.png/tED7ZOGBHsIdZWDvXty16ULCmAoMeilw8lrnUfJa51E\"/><figcaption>6. 出現上腹部疼痛（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"6. 出現上腹部疼痛（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251105/1062756386846674944083159.png/wBG2XCPqxyBsiMU-O_YbLHugI-JnKSZE39N7Zd_Te2U\"/><figcaption>6. 出現上腹部疼痛（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7. 有牙痛或下頜痛（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251105/1062756388742631424795460.png/N8FmyZgAWdTW_l6kOd8TIdnSHbJ0MH1cflAcq35QHKs\"/><figcaption>7. 有牙痛或下頜痛（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7. 有牙痛或下頜痛（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251105/1062756379648856064305721.png/qxFUEPY-U3dHAbBJES0n0IdWtLBwgzkc-IYjHviGIx4\"/><figcaption>7. 有牙痛或下頜痛（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>香港婦突劇烈頭痛昏厥！「腦動脈瘤破裂」急手術搶命成功</p><p>【本文獲「中天新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:01.658947+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1312,"images":33,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T01:30:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:58.467486+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:58.467486+00:00","content_hash":"f80674f6682dc9731ff577be9c75df219637e71e7530ad1ec74f1a31eb0dc912","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}